## 2. Completed Test Matrix & Empirical Denominators

All tests were executed locally through Antigravity with strict thread isolation:

1. **Unit Test Suite**: 98/98 unit tests passed cleanly in 21 s ([ANTIGRAVITY_UNIT_TESTS.log](file:///D:/SCRIPTS/GitHub/OWC-Physical-Layer-Security-DRL-RIS--Research/VLC_Simulation/OWC/manuscript/research_draft_v2/release_audit/ANTIGRAVITY_UNIT_TESTS.log)).
2. **Statistical Multiplicity Suite (`release_statistics.py`)**: 18 paired contrasts (3 budgets × 3 scheme comparisons × 2 metrics), 10 matched seeds (42–51), 1,024 sign flips each, full-family 18-hypothesis Holm step-down correction ([statistical_robustness.json](file:///D:/SCRIPTS/GitHub/OWC-Physical-Layer-Security-DRL-RIS--Research/VLC_Simulation/OWC/manuscript/research_draft_v2/release_audit/statistical_robustness.json)).
3. **Full Policy Replay (`release_validation.py --phase replay`)**: All 90 saved CNN+DND policies across budgets (2k, 5k, 10k) and schemes (Baseline, Fixed RIS, Joint RIS) reloaded and evaluated for 1,000 greedy slots (90,000 slots total); 360,000 metric values compared against recorded runs with absolute tolerance $< 10^{-10}$ (`all_match=True`, [full_policy_replay.json](file:///D:/SCRIPTS/GitHub/OWC-Physical-Layer-Security-DRL-RIS--Research/VLC_Simulation/OWC/manuscript/research_draft_v2/release_audit/full_policy_replay.json)).
4. **Finite-Grid Sensitivity (`release_validation.py --phase grid`)**: 15 cases (5 geometries × 3 noise offsets), 46,875 discrete action evaluations ([geometry_grid_sensitivity.json](file:///D:/SCRIPTS/GitHub/OWC-Physical-Layer-Security-DRL-RIS--Research/VLC_Simulation/OWC/manuscript/research_draft_v2/release_audit/geometry_grid_sensitivity.json)).
5. **Frozen Policy Zero-Shot Transfer (`release_validation.py --phase transfer`)**: 120 transfer evaluations (30 nominal-trained 10k policies × 4 changed geometries, 200 slots each = 24,000 slots total; [frozen_policy_geometry_transfer.json](file:///D:/SCRIPTS/GitHub/OWC-Physical-Layer-Security-DRL-RIS--Research/VLC_Simulation/OWC/manuscript/research_draft_v2/release_audit/frozen_policy_geometry_transfer.json)).
6. **Calibrated Current-Domain 4-PAM Diagnostic (`run_calibrated_ris_diagnostic.py`)**: 9 scenario/SNR grids (28,125 action evaluations) under an explicit equiprobable Gray 4-PAM channel with independent shared uniform jamming and Gaussian noise ([diagnostic_summary.json](file:///D:/SCRIPTS/GitHub/OWC-Physical-Layer-Security-DRL-RIS--Research/VLC_Simulation/OWC/output_figures/ris/calibrated_diagnostic_v1/diagnostic_summary.json) and 9 NPZ files). Numerical quadrature error $< 10^{-8}$, 300k-symbol Monte Carlo BER match $< 0.0025$, colocated secrecy identically 0.000000 bits/use.
7. **Build Validation (`validate_manuscript_build.py`)**: 337 cryptographic SHA256 hashes matched, zero missing citations, zero overfull boxes, 2 harmless underfull paragraph warnings ([BUILD_VALIDATION.json](file:///D:/SCRIPTS/GitHub/OWC-Physical-Layer-Security-DRL-RIS--Research/VLC_Simulation/OWC/manuscript/research_draft_v2/BUILD_VALIDATION.json)).

